*7 Help          > • On the sidebar, up and down pick a section; right or Enter
                 │   opens it.
                 │ • Help, Streams, Recognitions, and Account have a tab bar:
                 │   left and right switch tabs, down or Enter goes into the
                 │   page.
                 │ • On a page, up and down move; right or Enter opens what is
                 │   selected; left or Esc comes back one level.
                 │ • The path at the top shows where you are. The bottom line
                 │   shows the command each action runs; y copies it.
                 │ • ctrl+k runs any command from a form. ? lists the keys of
                 │   the screen; the Keys tab lists them all.
